# Copied to ~/.config/lockscreen-contact, which is NOT in this repo.
#
# This repo is public, and a lock screen notice carries a real name, a real phone
# number and possibly an address — exactly the things not to publish. Keep the
# real file outside git.
#
#   cp lockscreen-contact.example ~/.config/lockscreen-contact
#   $EDITOR ~/.config/lockscreen-contact
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored, blank lines dropped. Shown centred at the
# bottom of the lock screen, over the current wallpaper.
#
# Keep it short — it is read at a glance by a stranger holding your laptop.

If found, please contact
your.name@example.com
+61 400 000 000
